{"name":"Arboretum","hex":"#70ba9f","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"arboretum","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A place where many varieties of tree are grown for research, educational, and ornamental purposes."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/arboretum"}],"entries":[{"title":"Arboretum","blocks":[{"text":"An arboretum is a botanical collection composed exclusively of trees and shrubs of a variety of species. It is a living museum of trees and woody plants, grown and cared for by an organization committed to their stewardship. Originally mostly created as a section in a larger garden or park for specimens of mostly non-local species, many modern arboreta are in botanical gardens as living collections of woody plants and are intended at least in part for scientific study."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/Arboretum.westonbirt.750pix.jpg/330px-Arboretum.westonbirt.750pix.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arboretum","wikidata":"Q272231"},{"title":"Arboretum (Zurich)","blocks":[{"text":"The Arboretum is a botanical garden, public park and arboretum in Switzerland. The garden is part of the so-called Quaianlagen, a series of lakefronts in Zurich. The area also houses a lido, a public bath with a lake sauna, and the Voliere Zürich including the Vogelpflegestation, a unique sanatorium for birds."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/71/Arboretum_Z%C3%BCrich_2013-09-21_16-38-56.JPG/330px-Arboretum_Z%C3%BCrich_2013-09-21_16-38-56.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arboretum_(Zurich)","wikidata":"Q630465"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2f/Visitors_approaching_the_weeping_spruce_at_RHS_Wisley_-_geograph.org.uk_-_847074.jpg/330px-Visitors_approaching_the_weeping_spruce